      "content": "As  shown  in  the  above  diagram,  after  running  for  1  hour  under  refrigerating  mode  and dehumidification mode, the setting temperature will increase about2 ̧ ; after another 1 hour, it will increase about2 ̧ again, and after 6 hours, it will cease; after running for 1 hour under heating mode, the setting temperature will decrease about4 ̧ , after another 1 hour, it will decrease the about 4 ̧ again, and after 3 hours, it will increase about 2 , and after other 3 hours, it will cease. ć"
    },
