        "t": 238.2913598,
        "r": 550.7860440499987,
        "b": 213.48072720000005
      },
      "content": "The trial running will last for 30 minutes and then the unit will be powered off. The unit will exit the trial running if it receives any remote-control signal during the trial running period."
